<!--
  Notification small icon: a plain bell silhouette. Android masks a status-bar icon to its alpha
  channel and renders it as a flat white/tinted shape regardless of fillColor — the previous
  android.R.drawable.ic_dialog_info was a full-colour platform dialog glyph, which the mask turned
  into an unrecognizable white blob. A single filled shape on a transparent background is what
  the platform actually expects here.
-->
